[00:13.24]1. To Christ, by our God, Jehovah, we have been drawn
[00:25.46]To be his disciples from now on.
[00:35.00]From Jehovah’s lofty throne,
[00:43.56]How the light of truth has shone.
[00:49.10]In our hearts, our faith has grown;
[00:55.28]Our lives we vow to disown.
[01:01.44](Chorus)
[01:02.18]To God we are dedicated; This is our choice.
[01:14.08]In him and in Jesus we now rejoice.
[01:25.18]2. In prayer we have come before Jehovah to say
[01:37.52]We’ll serve him forever and obey.
[01:49.26]It’s a joy beyond compare,
[01:55.60]One that we are glad to share,
[02:01.24]As Jehovah’s name we bear,
[02:07.24]And Kingdom truth we declare.
[02:13.46](Chorus)
[02:14.14]To God we are dedicated; This is our choice.
[02:26.02]In him and in Jesus we now rejoice.
